// ActivityTimeline: what happened here, newest first, grouped by day, and who did it - the person or their
// assistant - so a person can tell at a glance what their assistant did and answer what it asks.
//
// Layout. A header: the title (level 2) and one quiet line under it (the app's `summary`, `loadingText` while it
// reads), and on its right the filter by who did it (Everyone, You, Your assistant: the kit's Segments in one group,
// `filterLabel` its name), wrapping under the words on a phone. Then the days, newest first: each day its label and
// one card of its rows. On a wide window the day's label stands in its own column beside its card, so a desktop's
// width reads as a calendar's margin; on a phone (the pair cannot both hold their least width) the label wraps above
// its card and the piece is one column. The whole piece holds to blocks.timeline-max, centred.
// A row is the event's time (its own narrow column, tabular), a rail, and the words: who did it (a caption: the
// muted ink for the person, the accent for the assistant), what (the label type, the row's focal line) and a detail
// that wraps. The rail runs down the day's card through every row's mark and stops at the first and last: the
// person's mark is a quiet ring, the assistant's is its spark in the accent, so its work shows down the rail without
// a word read. A list is rows, not cards: the rows of a day share one card (surface, the theme's line, the card's
// corner; the line holds it in a theme whose page and surface are one colour) and are divided by the one line.
//
// States, declared once as axes:
//   data   many (the days), long (every word wraps inside its own column; nothing is cut), empty (one card where the
//          rows would be: a quiet disc with the rail's mark, `emptyTitle`, and `emptyText` saying what will appear
//          here), loading (the header and filter stay, the line under the title says `loadingText` as a status, and a
//          day stands in bones in the real grid - a label bar, then rows of time, ring and lines - so nothing moves
//          when the events arrive), failed (one card with the critical line at its start and the critical disc, the
//          sentence in the ink - status ink is kept for the page and surface - and `retryLabel`, the one filled way
//          on; role alert). A filter that leaves no event (data many) says `filteredText` on the empty card with
//          `showAllLabel`, the way back to Everyone.
//   agent  none; proposed (the event `agentKey` names is the assistant's ask, waiting: its row carries the accent
//          line at its start and its mark is an open ring, `proposedNote` says it waits, and its two answer words,
//          `acceptLabel` - the state's one filled button - and `rejectLabel`, sit under it; a filter never hides
//          it, for what waits for the person stays in sight); changed (the event `agentKey` names is the assistant's
//          latest act: the accent line at its start, `changedNote`, and `undoLabel`, which takes it back). The
//          assistant's other events keep their spark only, so the accent line stays the signal of what is open.
// The person's segment and an agent's tool reach the app's same filter value, and the event's Undo and an agent's
// tool the same undo (one ledger, two doors: starter/playground/journeys/blocks). Every word is a prop or the
// event's own; every value a Theme token or a blocks.timeline-* size.
//
// Section, Proposal and TopBar live inline in this package's index.contract, which a sibling file cannot import
// (contract-use-cycle), so the day's card and the agent's answers are drawn here, in their manner.
use Words, ActionButton, Segment from "__SCOPE__/components"

// One event: its key (an agent names it), the day it belongs to ("Today", "Mon 14 Oct": the app's words, already
// in newest-first order), its time, who did it (the app's name for them: "You", "Your assistant", "Priya Nair"),
// what happened, a short detail ("" for none) and by whom: "person" or "agent". Named for the piece: DetailPanel
// exports its own Event.
shape TimelineEvent
  key: string
  day: string
  time: string
  actor: string
  title: string
  detail: string
  by: string

// The bones breathe while the events load, so the state reads as in progress, not as drawn rows.
keyframes timeline-breathe
  50% opacity=0.55

// The days in the order their events come, each once.
fn timelineDays(days: string[]): string[] = days.filter((d, i) => days.indexOf(d) == i)

// The rail's mark: "person" a quiet ring, "agent" the assistant's spark (filled, the accent), "asks" an open ring
// in the accent (the assistant's ask, not yet done), "ghost" a bone's dot while the events load. `above` and
// `below` draw the rail's line through the mark's own square, behind it, so the rail runs unbroken; the mark's
// surface stops it where the ring is.
component TimelineMark
  props
    kind: string
    above: bool
    below: bool
  view
    svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="blocks.timeline-mark" height="blocks.timeline-mark" aria-hidden=true flex-shrink=0
      if above
        path d="M10 0v10" stroke="theme.color.line" stroke-width=2
      if below
        path d="M10 10v10" stroke="theme.color.line" stroke-width=2
      if kind == "agent"
        circle cx=10 cy=10 r=9 fill="theme.color.surface"
        path d="M10 2.2l1.8 5.2 5.2 1.8-5.2 1.8L10 16.2l-1.8-5.2L3 9.2l5.2-1.8Z" fill="theme.color.accent"
      else if kind == "asks"
        circle cx=10 cy=10 r=7 fill="theme.color.surface" stroke="theme.color.accent" stroke-width=2 stroke-dasharray="3 2.5"
      else if kind == "ghost"
        circle cx=10 cy=10 r=5 fill="theme.color.fill"
      else
        circle cx=10 cy=10 r=4.5 fill="theme.color.surface" stroke="theme.color.ink-muted" stroke-width=1.5

// The rail beside a row: a segment above the mark (none on a day's first row), the mark, a segment below it to the
// row's end (none on the last). The row draws no vertical padding of its own, so the segments meet across rows.
component TimelineRail
  props
    kind: string
    first: bool
    last: bool
  view
    column aria-hidden=true width="blocks.timeline-mark" flex-shrink=0 align-items="center" align-self="stretch"
      box height="theme.space.md" width="blocks.timeline-rail" background-color=(first ? "transparent" : "theme.color.line")
      TimelineMark(kind=kind, above=(not first), below=(not last))
      box flex=1 width="blocks.timeline-rail" background-color=(last ? "transparent" : "theme.color.line")

// One event as a row: time, rail, then who, what and the detail; the event `agentKey` names also says its note and
// holds its answers (proposed: accept and reject; changed: undo).
component TimelineRow
  props
    event: TimelineEvent
    first: bool
    last: bool
    open: enum<"none", "proposed", "changed">
    note: string
    acceptLabel: string
    rejectLabel: string
    undoLabel: string
    accept: action
    reject: action
    undo: action
    testId: string
  view
    row testId=testId role="listitem" align-items="stretch" gap="theme.space.md" padding-left="theme.space.lg" padding-right="theme.space.lg" border-top-width=(first ? "0" : "theme.line.width") border-top-style="solid" border-top-color="theme.color.line" border-left-width="blocks.timeline-mark-line" border-left-style="solid" border-left-color=(open != "none" ? "theme.color.accent" : "transparent")
      text event.time testId=`${testId}-time` width="blocks.timeline-time" flex-shrink=0 padding-top="theme.space.md" padding-bottom="theme.space.md" box-sizing="border-box" overflow-wrap="break-word" font="theme.type.caption" color="theme.color.ink-muted" font-variant-numeric="tabular-nums"
      TimelineRail(kind=(open == "proposed" ? "asks" : event.by == "agent" ? "agent" : "person"), first=first, last=last)
      column flex=1 min-width=0 gap="theme.space.xs" padding-top="theme.space.md" padding-bottom="theme.space.md"
        text event.actor testId=`${testId}-actor` overflow-wrap="break-word" font="theme.type.caption" color=(event.by == "agent" ? "theme.color.accent" : "theme.color.ink-muted")
        text event.title testId=`${testId}-title` overflow-wrap="break-word" font="theme.type.label" color="theme.color.ink"
        if event.detail != ""
          text event.detail testId=`${testId}-detail` overflow-wrap="break-word" font="theme.type.caption" color="theme.color.ink-muted"
        if open != "none"
          column gap="theme.space.sm" margin-top="theme.space.xs"
            if note != ""
              text note testId=`${testId}-note` overflow-wrap="break-word" font="theme.type.caption" color="theme.color.accent"
            row role="group" aria-label=event.title flex-wrap="wrap" gap="theme.space.sm"
              if open == "proposed"
                ActionButton(opens="", label=acceptLabel, kind="primary", interaction="idle", outcome="none", press=accept, testId=`${testId}-accept`)
                ActionButton(opens="", label=rejectLabel, kind="plain", interaction="idle", outcome="none", press=reject, testId=`${testId}-reject`)
              else
                ActionButton(opens="", label=undoLabel, kind="plain", interaction="idle", outcome="none", press=undo, testId=`${testId}-undo`)

// A day: its label in its own column (beside the card when the window holds both, above it when not), then its
// rows on one card.
component TimelineDay
  props
    day: string
    events: TimelineEvent[]
    agent: enum<"none", "proposed", "changed">
    agentKey: string
    proposedNote: string
    changedNote: string
    acceptLabel: string
    rejectLabel: string
    undoLabel: string
    accept: action
    reject: action
    undo: action
    // the rows' testIds start with it, so a row is found by its event's key wherever its day falls
    rowsId: string
    testId: string
  view
    row testId=testId flex-wrap="wrap" align-items="flex-start" column-gap="theme.space.xl" row-gap="theme.space.sm"
      column flex=1 min-width="blocks.timeline-day-min" padding-top="theme.space.md" box-sizing="border-box"
        Words(text=day, kind="label", outcome="none", level=3, testId=`${testId}-label`)
      column role="list" aria-label=day flex=4 min-width="blocks.timeline-rows-min" box-sizing="border-box" background-color="theme.color.surface" border-radius="theme.radius.card" border-width="theme.line.width" border-style="solid" border-color="theme.color.line" overflow="hidden"
        for e, i in events key=e.key
          TimelineRow(event=e, first=(i == 0), last=(i == events.length - 1), open=(agent != "none" and e.key == agentKey ? agent : "none"), note=(agent == "proposed" ? proposedNote : changedNote), acceptLabel=acceptLabel, rejectLabel=rejectLabel, undoLabel=undoLabel, accept=accept, reject=reject, undo=undo, testId=`${rowsId}-${e.key}`)

// A quiet row while the events load: the real row's grid (time, rail and ring, two lines), every word a bar.
component TimelineGhost
  props
    share: string
    first: bool
    last: bool
  view
    row aria-hidden=true align-items="stretch" gap="theme.space.md" padding-left="theme.space.lg" padding-right="theme.space.lg" border-top-width=(first ? "0" : "theme.line.width") border-top-style="solid" border-top-color="theme.color.line" border-left-width="blocks.timeline-mark-line" border-left-style="solid" border-left-color="transparent"
      column width="blocks.timeline-time" flex-shrink=0 padding-top="theme.space.md" box-sizing="border-box"
        box width="70%" height="blocks.timeline-bone" background-color="theme.color.fill" border-radius="theme.radius.pill"
      TimelineRail(kind="ghost", first=first, last=last)
      column flex=1 min-width=0 gap="theme.space.sm" padding-top="theme.space.md" padding-bottom="theme.space.md"
        box width="30%" height="blocks.timeline-bone" background-color="theme.color.fill" border-radius="theme.radius.pill"
        box width=share height="blocks.timeline-bone" background-color="theme.color.fill" border-radius="theme.radius.pill"

// One card that speaks for the rows' place: a disc with its mark, a title and a sentence, and one way on. "quiet"
// for empty and a filter with nothing in it (the rail's ring on the fill), "critical" for failed (the critical line
// at its start and the critical disc; the words stay in the ink).
component TimelineState
  props
    tone: enum<"quiet", "critical">
    title: string
    text: string
    actionLabel: string
    press: action
    testId: string
  view
    row testId=testId role=(tone == "critical" ? "alert" : "status") align-items="flex-start" gap="theme.space.lg" padding="theme.space.xl" background-color="theme.color.surface" border-radius="theme.radius.card" border-top-width="theme.line.width" border-right-width="theme.line.width" border-bottom-width="theme.line.width" border-left-width=(tone == "critical" ? "blocks.timeline-mark-line" : "theme.line.width") border-style="solid" border-top-color="theme.color.line" border-right-color="theme.color.line" border-bottom-color="theme.color.line" border-left-color=(tone == "critical" ? "theme.color.critical" : "theme.color.line")
      svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" width="blocks.timeline-glyph" height="blocks.timeline-glyph" aria-hidden=true flex-shrink=0
        if tone == "critical"
          circle cx=20 cy=20 r=20 fill="theme.color.critical"
          path d="M20 11v11" stroke="theme.color.critical-ink" stroke-width=3 stroke-linecap="round"
          circle cx=20 cy=28.5 r=1.9 fill="theme.color.critical-ink"
        else
          circle cx=20 cy=20 r=20 fill="theme.color.fill"
          path d="M20 8v6M20 26v6" stroke="theme.color.ink-muted" stroke-width=2 stroke-linecap="round"
          circle cx=20 cy=20 r=5 fill="none" stroke="theme.color.ink-muted" stroke-width=2
      column flex=1 min-width=0 max-width="blocks.timeline-measure" gap="theme.space.sm"
        if title != ""
          text title testId=`${testId}-title` overflow-wrap="break-word" font="theme.type.label" color="theme.color.ink"
        text text testId=`${testId}-text` overflow-wrap="break-word" font="theme.type.body" color=(tone == "critical" ? "theme.color.ink" : "theme.color.ink-muted")
        if actionLabel != ""
          row margin-top="theme.space.xs"
            ActionButton(opens="", label=actionLabel, kind="primary", interaction="idle", outcome="none", press=press, testId=`${testId}-action`)

component ActivityTimeline
  props
    title: string
    summary: string
    filterLabel: string
    everyoneLabel: string
    youLabel: string
    agentLabel: string
    // "everyone", "person" or "agent": the events shown, by who did them
    filter: string
    // what an agent's change of the filter said ("" when the person set it, or nobody did)
    filterNote: string
    events: TimelineEvent[]
    loadingText: string
    emptyTitle: string
    emptyText: string
    filteredText: string
    showAllLabel: string
    failedTitle: string
    failedText: string
    retryLabel: string
    agentKey: string
    proposedNote: string
    changedNote: string
    acceptLabel: string
    rejectLabel: string
    undoLabel: string
    data: enum<"many", "empty", "loading", "failed", "long">
    agent: enum<"none", "proposed", "changed">
    choose: action
    retry: action
    accept: action
    reject: action
    undo: action
    testId: string
  // The filter's key: "person" or "agent", and any other key is everyone, so an unknown one hides nothing.
  derive by = filter == "person" or filter == "agent" ? filter : "everyone"
  // The events the filter keeps; the assistant's open ask stays whatever the filter.
  derive shown = events.filter(e => by == "everyone" or e.by == by or (agent == "proposed" and e.key == agentKey))
  derive days = timelineDays(shown.map(e => e.day))
  derive rows = data == "many" or data == "long"
  view
    column testId=testId width="100%" max-width="blocks.timeline-max" margin-left="auto" margin-right="auto" box-sizing="border-box" gap="theme.space.xl" aria-busy=(data == "loading")
      row flex-wrap="wrap" align-items="flex-start" column-gap="theme.space.xl" row-gap="theme.space.md"
        column flex=1 min-width="blocks.timeline-head-min" gap="theme.space.xs"
          Words(text=title, kind="title", outcome="none", level=2, testId=`${testId}-title`)
          if data == "loading"
            text loadingText testId=`${testId}-status` role="status" overflow-wrap="break-word" font="theme.type.caption" color="theme.color.ink-muted"
          else if rows and summary != ""
            text summary testId=`${testId}-status` overflow-wrap="break-word" font="theme.type.caption" color="theme.color.ink-muted"
        column flex=1 min-width="blocks.timeline-filter-min" max-width="blocks.timeline-filter-max" gap="theme.space.sm"
          row role="group" aria-label=filterLabel testId=`${testId}-filter` gap="theme.space.xs" padding="theme.space.xs" background-color="theme.color.fill" border-radius="theme.radius.control"
            Segment(label=everyoneLabel, on=(by == "everyone"), interaction="idle", press=choose("everyone"), testId=`${testId}-filter-everyone`)
            Segment(label=youLabel, on=(by == "person"), interaction="idle", press=choose("person"), testId=`${testId}-filter-person`)
            Segment(label=agentLabel, on=(by == "agent"), interaction="idle", press=choose("agent"), testId=`${testId}-filter-agent`)
          if filterNote != ""
            row align-items="flex-start" gap="theme.space.sm" padding-left="theme.space.sm" padding-right="theme.space.sm"
              TimelineMark(kind="agent", above=false, below=false)
              text filterNote testId=`${testId}-filter-note` role="status" flex=1 min-width=0 overflow-wrap="break-word" font="theme.type.caption" color="theme.color.accent"
      if data == "loading"
        row aria-hidden=true testId=`${testId}-loading` animation="timeline-breathe 1.8s ease-in-out infinite" flex-wrap="wrap" align-items="flex-start" column-gap="theme.space.xl" row-gap="theme.space.sm"
          column flex=1 min-width="blocks.timeline-day-min" padding-top="theme.space.md" box-sizing="border-box"
            box width="blocks.timeline-ghost-day" height="blocks.timeline-bone" background-color="theme.color.fill" border-radius="theme.radius.pill"
          column flex=4 min-width="blocks.timeline-rows-min" box-sizing="border-box" background-color="theme.color.surface" border-radius="theme.radius.card" border-width="theme.line.width" border-style="solid" border-color="theme.color.line" overflow="hidden"
            for share, i in ["64%", "48%", "56%"] key=share
              TimelineGhost(share=share, first=(i == 0), last=(i == 2))
      else if data == "failed"
        TimelineState(tone="critical", title=failedTitle, text=failedText, actionLabel=retryLabel, press=retry, testId=`${testId}-failed`)
      else if data == "empty" or events.length == 0
        TimelineState(tone="quiet", title=emptyTitle, text=emptyText, actionLabel="", press=retry, testId=`${testId}-empty`)
      else if shown.length == 0
        TimelineState(tone="quiet", title="", text=filteredText, actionLabel=showAllLabel, press=choose("everyone"), testId=`${testId}-filtered`)
      else
        column gap="theme.space.xl"
          for d, n in days key=d
            TimelineDay(day=d, events=shown.filter(e => e.day == d), agent=agent, agentKey=agentKey, proposedNote=proposedNote, changedNote=changedNote, acceptLabel=acceptLabel, rejectLabel=rejectLabel, undoLabel=undoLabel, accept=accept, reject=reject, undo=undo, rowsId=testId, testId=`${testId}-day-${n}`)
